        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n\n\nNestled in the charming and sought-after coastal village of Malahide, this spacious 2 bedroom apartment offers the perfect combination of modern living and a prime location.\n\nKey features include:\n- Bright, spacious living areas\n- Parking available\n- Rent includes refuse charge\n\nLocation Highlights: Jameson Orchard is located just minutes from Malahide Village, known for its bustling atmosphere, vibrant cafes, restaurants, and shops. Malahide Castle and Gardens are nearby, providing scenic walks and a range of leisure activities. The area is well-serviced by public transport, including Malahide DART Station, offering quick access to Dublin City Centre. Dublin Airport is also only a short drive away.\n\n*There are multiple property types available in this development. The photos shown here may not be of the actual unit available but represent the standard of finish."
